sequenceDiagram
    actor Author
    participant System as System

    Author->>System: Submits article form
    
    alt Content field is empty (Error Scenario)
        System-->>Author: Rejects submission and displays error "Content is required"
    else Status set to "Draft" (Alternative Scenario)
        System-->>Author: Saves article as draft and redirects to article list (not visible to public)
    else Form complete and Status set to "Published" (Nominal Scenario)
        System-->>Author: Saves article as published and redirects to article list
    end